{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QPx95nebh4TzSpJFMJPX7b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Architecture Decision Records\n2\t\n3\tDecisions that are hard to reverse, surprising without context, and the\n4\tresult of a real trade-off. See `docs/agents/domain.md` for how agents\n5\tconsume these and `CONTEXT.md` for the project glossary.\n6\t\n7\t| # | Decision | Date |\n8\t|---|----------|------|\n9\t| [ADR-001](ADR-001-alien-signals-for-reactivity.md) | alien-signals as the reactivity primitive | 2026-06-28 |\n10\t| [ADR-002](ADR-002-no-shadow-dom.md) | No Shadow DOM | 2026-06-28 |\n11\t| [ADR-003](ADR-003-standard-schema-for-prop-validation.md) | Standard Schema for prop validation | 2026-06-28 |\n12\t| [ADR-004](ADR-004-client-bundle-size-outranks-ergonomics.md) | Client bundle size outranks API ergonomics | 2026-07-25 |\n13\t| [ADR-005](ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md) | Single-file components with build-time stripping of render code | 2026-09-23 |\n14\t| [ADR-006][adr-006] | Authored HTML scaffold served by Hono | 2026-09-25 |\n15\t| [ADR-007][adr-007] | Client templater: signal props, reactive regions, mount | 2026-10-04 |\n16\t| [ADR-008][adr-008] | Serialized server state and unidirectional hydration | 2026-10-04 |\n17\t| [ADR-009][adr-009] | Server render support loaded through the render link (amends ADR-005) | 2026-10-14 |\n18\t| [ADR-010][adr-010] | Preact owns the host, the element owns its children | 2026-11-08 |\n19\t| [ADR-011][adr-011] | Core renders an empty host with a kept render link (amends ADR-010) | 2026-11-10 |\n20\t\n21\t[adr-006]: ADR-006-hono-html-scaffold.md\n22\t[adr-007]: ADR-007-client-templater.md\n23\t[adr-008]: ADR-008-serialized-server-state.md\n24\t[adr-009]: ADR-009-server-render-support-through-render-link.md\n25\t[adr-010]: ADR-010-preact-adapter-ownership-split.md\n26\t[adr-011]: ADR-011-core-renders-empty-host.md\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":nul