{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UGg1Lhu85uk1t6qrcZ82bk","type":"tool_result","content":"549\t#### `ComponentBuilder`\n550\t\n551\tThe object returned by [`define`](#define). Includes methods:\n552\t\n553\t| Method | Returns | Description |\n554\t|--------|---------|-------------|\n555\t| `.TAG` | `string` | The tag name passed to `define`. See [`.TAG`](#tag). |\n556\t| `.withProps(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Declare reactive attributes. See [Props](#props). |\n557\t| `.withRefs(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Declare DOM refs resolved once the element connects. See [Refs](#refs-1). |\n558\t| `.withContexts(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Consume context values published by an ancestor. See [`withContexts`](#withcontexts). |\n559\t| `.render(fn, opts?)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Attach a server-render function. See [`.render`](#builderrenderfn-options) below. Not to be confused with the DOM helper [`microtags/render`](#microtagsrender). |\n560\t| `.setup(fn)` | `MicrotagElementClass` | Registers the custom element and returns its class. See [`setup`](#setup) below. |\n561\t\n562\tMethods `withProps`, `withRefs`, and `withContexts` each return a new builder,\n563\tso they chain in any order; `setup` ends the chain by registering the element.\n564\t\n565\t---------------------------------------------------------\n566\t\n567\t### `builder.withProps`\n568\t\n569\tDeclare reactive attributes via `withProps`. Each prop becomes:\n570\t\n571\t* An observed HTML attribute (auto-synced via `attributeChangedCallback`)\n572\t* A signal at `ctx.props.propName`\n573\t* Four built-in coercers turn raw attribute strings into typed values:\n574\t\n575\t| Coercer | Attribute present | Attribute absent |\n576\t|---------|-------------------|------------------|\n577\t| `p.string()` | the raw string | `\"\"` |\n578\t| `p.number()` | `Number(val)`, so `NaN` if not numeric | `NaN` |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f913a53-0f10-4f84-aeba-59a85cf43fa6","uuid":"c328d71a-1702-43f6-9dc4-7dd485c9e765","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:34:50.413Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.form-associated-02-form-associated-link-and-internals/README.md","content":"#### `ComponentBuilder`\n\nThe object returned by [`define`](#define). Includes methods:\n\n| Method | Returns | Description |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| `.TAG` | `string` | The tag name passed to `define`. See [`.TAG`](#tag). |\n| `.withProps(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Declare reactive attributes. See [Props](#props). |\n| `.withRefs(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Declare DOM refs resolved once the element connects. See [Refs](#refs-1). |\n| `.withContexts(fn)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Consume context values published by an ancestor. See [`withContexts`](#withcontexts). |\n| `.render(fn, opts?)` | `ComponentBuilder` | Attach a server-render function. See [`.render`](#builderrenderfn-options) below. Not to be confused with the DOM helper [`microtags/render`](#microtagsrender). |\n| `.setup(fn)` | `MicrotagElementClass` | Registers the custom element and returns its class. See [`setup`](#setup) below. |\n\nMethods `withProps`, `withRefs`, and `withContexts` each return a new builder,\nso they chain in any order; `setup` ends the chain by registering the element.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n### `builder.withProps`\n\nDeclare reactive attributes via `withProps`. Each prop becomes:\n\n* An observed HTML attribute (auto-synced via `attributeChangedCallback`)\n* A signal at `ctx.props.propName`\n* Four built-in coercers turn raw attribute strings into typed values:\n\n| Coercer | Attribute present | Attribute absent |\n|---------|-------------------|------------------|\n| `p.string()` | the raw string | `\"\"` |\n| `p.number()` | `Number(val)`, so `NaN` if not numeric | `NaN` |","numLines":30,"startLine":549,"totalLines":1896}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UGg1Lhu85uk1t6qrcZ82bk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
